### Run `npm run watch` first. Today's records (no date parameter means asOfDate = today)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?$select=Employee_PersonnelNumber,PersonnelSubarea&$orderby=Employee_PersonnelNumber

### As of a date: the record that is effective on 2025-06-30
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?asOfDate=2025-06-30&$select=Employee_PersonnelNumber,PersonnelSubarea&$orderby=Employee_PersonnelNumber

### As of the day the second record begins
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?asOfDate=2026-07-01&$select=Employee_PersonnelNumber,PersonnelSubarea&$orderby=Employee_PersonnelNumber

### A date range: both of Ana's records touch June and July 2026
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?fromDate=2026-06-01&toDate=2026-07-31&$filter=Employee_PersonnelNumber eq '00001234'&$select=BeginDate,EndDate,PersonnelSubarea&$orderby=BeginDate

### Time constraint 2: the last day of the permit, then the gap
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/ParkingPermits?asOfDate=2025-05-31

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/ParkingPermits?asOfDate=2025-06-01

### Who was employed on 2024-06-01? Only Ana: Ben and Chloe were hired later
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?asOfDate=2024-06-01&$select=PersonnelSubarea

### Rejected: asOfDate together with a range, HTTP 400
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?asOfDate=2025-06-30&fromDate=2025-01-01&toDate=2025-12-31

### Rejected: a date that is not YYYY-MM-DD, HTTP 400
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?asOfDate=30.06.2025
